                "description": "The Contemporary Lever Mortise Lockset is available 5 different finishes including Satin Nickel, and Polished Chrome. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. The Contemporary Mortise Lockset has a very sleek design that makes it a great choice for contemporary homes. Choose from a several lockable functions including sing cylinder and double cylinders entrysets.\r\n",
